# CGS ATTENDANCE SYSTEM - CLOUD ARCHITECTURE & DEPLOYMENT PLAN

## 1. Cloud Architecture Overview
- **Database (Cloud)**: Supabase PostgreSQL (Managed Free Tier)
- **Backend (API)**: NestJS deployed on Render or Railway
- **Frontend (Web App)**: Next.js 14 deployed on Netlify or Vercel
- **Teacher URL**: Permanent HTTPS link hosted on Netlify (e.g. `https://cgs-attendance.netlify.app`)

